From e2ea7c71aeebfd899e75b5de931db43497b41b34 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michal Grygarek <michal.grygarek@accenture.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 09:17:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] B(fpga): dlouhe casovace na 1ms zakladne (B1, top_v3)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

⚠️ ZMENA CHOVANI, mimo optimalizacni radu (trida B, zadani kap. 5 B1).
Nabeh (boot_cnt), timeout kalibrace (cal_tmo), prodleva opakovani
(rt_dly) a drzeni koherence (coh_hold) pocitaji tiky okna sondy pwend
(1 ms; pwc presunuto pred nabeh), v SIM_TOP tik 100 taktu. N = ceil(
puvodni doba / P): nabeh 168 tiku (167..168 ms, drive 167,77), timeout
5369 (5368..5369 ms), opakovani 11 (10..11 ms, drive 10,49), koherence
168. SIM_TOP: nabeh 20 tiku (1900..2000 taktu), ostatni doby jako drive.
Sirky 24/29/20/24 -> 8/13/4/8 b (yosys: -65 FF, -64 ALU, -59 LUT,
ridici sady -14; hlavni instance zmerila jako variantu tmr -47 CLS).

Test dob sim/tb_tmr.sv (run_ps1_doplnek.txt, tmr): nabeh 1964 a 1924
taktu (meze 1900..2003), opakovani 1048595 (meze 1048500..1048603),
koherence a timeout po 3 ticich. topv3, topv3cal, holdinv, topv3ovf,
topv3pw PASS (stopa se proti base/ lisi: zamer).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
